{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_10_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a550e4a501c349bff378e41953e5c77023cfee0e63e34748c45fd70ae1cd0f25",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000024:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数日前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:037f33dbdf1dd879eea71f59c3dc02eeda7be38f1a9f6aa120a6925c87a575f5",
      "text": "嚯，挺不错的嘛。\n用这个的话，高处的大扫除也……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6ca02f42ed0579fd6c191b461b53756c7b41bd3e31f4735cd29bc2a83939758",
      "text": "葛之叶君，真巧啊。\n你也是来看清扫用具的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79c9979d3942570bc2cfaf1d0fd3c9ac1c995bee23a33becdf1ca10488c81bf4",
      "text": "是啊，我本来就是干保洁的。\n这次也想着用这个出一份力。硲先生呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5115731e10a644eccc1aeb7f2c6e0ebbe805b442b90956ef8c987fac460e942c",
      "text": "我是觉得除了数学之外，作为爱好的打扫\n或许也能派上用场，才来到这里的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:243fc3d8bfa1a5746804d4e7e0896938a947704c2391e9444edc9c44f011cf2d",
      "text": "但是，应该避免对策重复吗。\n这里还是交给专业人士……哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec62a97435800c94e30a4422fb6dbbd4dbbc0550fe292ad4584723cd7669c36c",
      "text": "……葛之叶君。据说这世上，\n存在着一种名为“双子穿搭”的事物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fb40c1b4f8bdda7fa5b2bf7bc072da761295078006432eae8216b0c2d306b0b",
      "text": "似乎是一种通过将外表搭配得如同双胞胎一般，\n进一步衬托彼此的风尚文化。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba20945120dcc93ca0438ec88732dfb45cdfd54cdc2666454ff4a36973a95622",
      "text": "若你不介意，我们要不要以“双子穿搭”\n来迎战这次的LIVE？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ebd42fcbf55e559e62f675f5dc07765feed60d44cfbe89f586ed21da49e3713",
      "text": "嚯。虽然对那种文化完全搞不懂，\n但要是跟硲先生联手，打扫起来确实会更顺手吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61c7a68e42e058d9c3430a5f82427e1b9f1ce3a48a62cb3dadd71cff68d31a6d",
      "text": "说起来……无论我们\n流了多少汗结束练习，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ee5e990283c8f0b2b2823737e5c6e8a7051ab370a5a86ca00ff6d8af5124773",
      "text": "到了第二天，不论是事务所还是练习室，\n连一点汗水和污渍的痕迹都没留下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:014ad60d375bbbf4af975d52a3e1a42093f632dff9b41cb6b41fd50f42640798",
      "text": "原来是你们两个打扫过了吗……！\n托你们的福，每天都能神清气爽地投入练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8df18284eb8c0ab930892a812f56270a374a3922e0052477a8587e1150d5a394",
      "text": "整理好环境，头脑与心灵也会随之梳理整齐。\n这就是清扫的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4279cbd807379ccefb3871e681242c86d7f19c8407f99c468359c359b37e03f",
      "text": "来吧，挡路的二位。\n接下来，该对你们进行大扫除了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_f:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98c0a65f5f5fcf54ec0fc1be86ef8253122b5d6a901927f2e0bf90ffd4374c40",
      "text": "就由我们这对双子穿搭的清洁工，\n来化解你们那僵硬凝固的头脑与心灵吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
